WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.038
Before listening, read the questions and predict the type of information you
need. Is it a time, a room number, or a registration deadline?

00:00:10.038 --> 00:00:19.768
The normal starting time is six, but next Tuesday the class begins at half past
six. Listen carefully for words that signal a change.

00:00:19.768 --> 00:00:29.704
Maya should go to room twelve on the second floor. The course fee is eighty
pounds. She may pay on the first day, but must register by Friday.

